{"id": "99210014", "name": "פונקציית הסתברות משותפת בטבלה – שולית, E[XY] ושונות משותפת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>לווקטור המקרי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((X,Y)\\)</span> פונקציית ההסתברות המשותפת הבאה (בשורות הערכים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span>, ובעמודות הערכים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span>):</p><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:10px 0\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:auto\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(X\\backslash Y\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(1\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(2\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\(1\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</td></tr></table></div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(Y=1)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[XY]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ג. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Cov}(X,Y)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> פונקציית ההסתברות השולית – סכום עמודה; \\(\\mathbb{E}[XY]\\) – סכום על כל המשבצות; \\(\\mathsf{Cov}(X,Y)=\\mathbb{E}[XY]-\\mathbb{E}[X]\\mathbb{E}[Y]\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — השולית של Y</b><br>מחברים את העמודה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y=1\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(Y=1)=\\mathbb{P}(X=0,Y=1)+\\mathbb{P}(X=1,Y=1)={{CT:1}}+{{CT:4}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — E[XY]</b><br>רק משבצות שבהן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X=1\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\neq0\\)</span> תורמות (בכל השאר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(XY=0\\)</span>):<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[XY]=1\\cdot1\\cdot{{CT:4}}+1\\cdot2\\cdot{{CT:5}}={{CT:7}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השונות המשותפת</b><br>מהשוליות:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X]=\\mathbb{P}(X=1)={{CT:8}},\\qquad \\mathbb{E}[Y]=1\\cdot{{CT:6}}+2\\cdot{{CT:9}}={{CT:10}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathsf{Cov}(X,Y)=\\mathbb{E}[XY]-\\mathbb{E}[X]\\mathbb{E}[Y]={{CT:7}}-{{CT:8}}\\cdot{{CT:10}}={{CT:11}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "pY1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "EXY", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "cv", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["EX", "EXY", "EY", "T", "cv", "kt", "pX1", "pY1", "pY2"], "nvariants": 50}